    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Scott Levin has been the reclusive senior Malkavian in Washington since the turn of the century, though most of his own clan barely realize he leads them. Living alone near Chevy Chase with only his computers for company, Levin becomes alarmingly lucid and dangerous while online, running six phone lines into government and criminal databases, designing viruses, and exchanging nightly intelligence with fellow Malkavians Dr. Stephen Norton and Dr. Jeffrey Granger.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>You always wear a friendly smile. Strange things are perpetually going on around you, demanding attention you can barely muster in conversation, but your computer still works better than people do.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Dr. Harry Hirsch. Disciplines (as printed): Auspex 5, Dominate 4, Fortitude 1, Obfuscate 4. Haven: house near Chevy Chase. Secrets: A. Ghoul: Malcolm Dobbs. Convert Disciplines by adding owned power Items from the disciplines compendium at Storyteller discretion.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
