      "name": "Dominate — 3 Advanced — Obedience",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Rather than requiring eye contact, you may use Dominate through skin-to-skin contact alone (a Physical Challenge may be needed on unwilling subjects). The touch need not be maintained while issuing the command, but only one command may be given per contact; using Dominate again requires touching the subject anew.</p>",
